      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "[Cu(Hdmg)2] (22.1 mg, 0.075 mmol) was dissolved in ethanol (1.25 ml) containing KOH (8.4 mg, 0.15 mmol) and combined at room temperature with an ethanolic solution (1 ml) of Gd(OAc)3·4H2O (41.1 mg, 0.1 mmol) and Gd(hfac)3·2H2O (163.4 mg, 0.2 mmol). Tetraphenylphosphonium chloride (57.1 mg, 0.15 mmol) in ethanol (0.5 ml) was added, colorless impurities were removed by filtration, and reddish brown plates of 1 precipitated from the filtrate at room temperature over one day.",
